        "text": "Refundability ensures that families receive at least $1,700 regardless of their tax liability.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "This proposed bill increases the refundable amount by $100 annually for the next three years.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The 2017 tax cuts established a refundable child tax credit of $1,400 adjusted for inflation.",
        "confidence": 0.91
