        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Increasing the refundable portion of the child tax credit over time improves its effectiveness as a poverty-reduction tool.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The existing structure of the child tax credit reflects a policy choice favoring partial refundability rather than full refundability.",
        "confidence": 0.91
