        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Indexing the child tax credit to inflation preserves its real value over time.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Families benefit from consistent access to the full child tax credit without requalifying for each child.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
