        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience values fairness in tax policy, particularly regarding children and earned benefits.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Common ground in policymaking requires compromise on specific, tangible elements like tax credits.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'child penalty' conveys a morally charged critique that resonates with the intended audience.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Economic progress should be measured in terms of accessible financial support for low- and middle-income families.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
